2. Audio
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

public/new_quake.mp3
public/new_info.mp3
public/new-report.mp3
public/new-tsunami.mp3

    Obtained from Pixabay (https://pixabay.com/) and used under the Pixabay
    Content License, which permits free commercial and non-commercial use
    without attribution. Note that the Pixabay licence does not permit
    redistributing the audio as a standalone downloadable file; these are
    included solely as alert sounds within the application.

public/tsunami-warning.mp3

    The tsunami warning chime of the Japan Meteorological Agency (気象庁 / JMA).
    This audio is the property of the JMA. It is NOT covered by the AGPL, and
    the Government of Japan Standard Terms of Use that apply to JMA's published
    data do not clearly extend to their broadcast alert audio. It is included
    here for fidelity to the official alerting sound. Anyone redistributing or
    deploying WebQuake should satisfy themselves that this use is acceptable in
    their jurisdiction, or replace the file.

